      "value": {
        "body": "A science degree in a subject such as Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics, Biology, Computer Science or Statistics. It is usually three years, with a four-year Honours or Honours-with-Research option at many universities under the NEP. It leads to jobs, an M.Sc, teaching (via B.Ed) or research."
